// Member m's stiffness k, its Beam's tenths (taMK) times a tenth, to taK, when it is not 1.0,
// which is never multiplied.
// Entry: AC = m. Exit: AC = 0 for 1.0, else 1 with taK set. IO is clobbered; FA and FB too when
// k is not 1.0. Called via jda taKOf.
taKOf, 0
